  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Cannonball** (1 review): Reviewer says the encore track listed as Cannonball on track 11 is actually Flurries [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Cause We Ended as Lovers (Stevie Wonder)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Cabriolet**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Dons Place**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Tuesday**: rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Cause We Ended as Lovers (Stevie)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Cabriolet**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Soulive2025-02-01.AKGCK63.Flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 126 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **soulive2025-02-01.travitz1**: source not stated; 0 songs; 158 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Mics were clamped to the middle rail, 14 feet up; the bonus coverage is the VIP pre-show soundcheck [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Soulive2025-02-01.AKGCK63.Flac24**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: AKG CK63/c4860b > ZOOM F3 (32 Bit) [1]. Also: Transfer: SD card to Audacity (slight amplify, normalize, dither to 24 bit), then CD WAV, FLAC, tagged in Foobar2000 [1]\n- **soulive2025-02-01.travitz1**: taped by Travitz [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Ardmore Music Hall: [Photos - Ardmore Music Hall](https://ardmoremusichall.com/photos/) [5]",
